<title>PAKISTAN: CRICKET-PAKISTAN BEAT NEW ZEALAND IN TEST.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-PAKISTAN BEAT NEW ZEALAND IN TEST.</headline>
<dateline>RAWALPINDI, Pakistan 1996-12-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan beat New Zealand by an innings and 13 runs on the fourth day of the second and final test on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scores:  New Zealand 249 and 168. Pakistan 430.</p>
</text>
